---
name: Whiskey Sour
ingredients:
  - type: Whiskey
    amount: '2'
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Lemon juice
    amount: 3/4
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: 'Simple syrup '
    amount: 1/2
    unit: oz
    garnish: false
  - type: Egg white
    amount: '1'
    unit: count
    garnish: false
  - type: Lemon
    amount: '1'
    unit: twist
    garnish: true
  - type: Maraschino cherry
    amount: '1'
    unit: count
    garnish: true
category:
  - whisky
image: ../../images/cocktails/whiskey-sour/image.jpg
sourceUrl: https://www.wineenthusiast.com/recipe/whiskey-sour-recipe/
---
1. Combine whiskey, lemon juice and simple syrup in cocktail shaker with ice.
1. Shake vigorously for 10–15 seconds. Strain into rocks glass over fresh ice.
1. Garnish with thick cut lemon twist and cherry, if desired.
